  "default_contract": "A/M norm inheritance: module > layer_loop > root > pre_rms_norm; eps=1e-5; standard residual; independent depth parameters; causal attention; gated=false; lm_head norm=rms_norm,tie_embedding=true; time_loop zero state/shared parameters; mHC streams=4,sinkhorn_iters=20,eps=1e-6; AttnRes without block_size=Full",
